  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: bbec7a84e96ca95458eba143068d1dd0, type: 3}
  title: Spine Animation
  sections:
  - heading: Spine for Unity
    text: To use Spine in Unity, download and import the free Spine-Unity package.
      This is required to use Spine with Timeflow. Once installed, the symbol USING_SPINE
      will be automatically added to your player settings to enable the related features.
    linkText: Spine-Unity Dowload
    url: https://en.esotericsoftware.com/spine-unity-download
  - heading: What is Spine?
    text: Spine is an animation tool that focuses specifically on 2D animation for
      games. Spine aims to have an efficient, streamlined workflow, both for creating
      animations using the editor and for making use of those animations in games
      using the Spine Runtimes.
    linkText: More Info
    url: https://en.esotericsoftware.com/spine-in-depth
  - heading: Timeflow Integration
    text: The included package defines behaviors specifically for working with Spine
      animations in Timeflow. Be sure to see the scenes included in the Spine add
      on package to see how it works.
    linkText: Documentation
    url: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/reference/behaviors/midi
  - heading: Render Pipeline
    text: The samples included with Timeflow use the built-in render pipeline. For
      use with URP, please download an install the Spine URP shaders package.
    linkText: Download URP Shaders UPM Package
    url: https://en.esotericsoftware.com/spine-unity-download
  - heading: Spine Software
    text: The animation assets are originally created in Spine. In Unity these assets
      are used like animation clips which can be sequenced and layered in Timeflow
      to choreograph animations.
    linkText: Spine Trial Download
    url: https://en.esotericsoftware.com/spine-download
  - heading: Legal Disclaimer
    text: "Timeflow has no affiliation with Esoteric Software and all respective
      rights are reserved by Esoteric Software\xAE \xA9 2013-2024 Esoteric Software
      LLC"
    linkText: Esoteric Software
    url: https://en.esotericsoftware.com/
  loadedLayout: 0
  isEditing: 0
